cb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4e5b3fbxETwQ7kNvwEwmT5y&_nc_oc=Adoxx7O4jOERYdWEQ2DigbM1EvXqHtIJfpQYSmAIVIrk-7bjvPguawxjckSxH7kk7mE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQsqEDPN8s1XEO4K06fIxI6qCvQg_sI_730WSaOmwLlmg&oe=6B05B3C2"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot2.png", "id": "1479977115825879", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036671_1479977119159212_2469253726876615802_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qskFJCnnC7MQ7kNvwGtr2__&_nc_oc=Adr5HTc9Rg6KPzHUgn2jcpUcSNXPBhmrGMpHzKoIkUOrjsBbGekaNaZoCkBl-q0GeIM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSW9HrFsXJ5jn5Y3-tob2p9viDIOLJNUWywF4StFh8dzg&oe=6B05D235"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LogoTrailerImageOculus.png", "id": "1521892718330882", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974574_1521892721664215_8879498928930505792_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IwubERQrNRwQ7kNvwGkDgws&_nc_oc=AdqpUcan-G-eVqMR0TsE7L0ceGboSaCckoAfTqmx51VkxfWdyh2s8GIxdfbCkHHtU20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQlpeOpZndN-ryhtujIr1nB62MzgYqK78ndkHx911QYKQ&oe=6B05D121"}, "display_name": "Joy Flight", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Motion Controls - Turn on the engine, crank the throttle and grab the flight stick using your VR hands.\n\nHuge Open World - Explore an expansive island chain with 29 distinct island runways to unlock.\n\nDynamic Weather System - Skirt the waves, dodge lightning and enjoy the rain as you fly through the storm with the dynamic weather system.\n\nFree Flight- Fly around the world with no limits, explore into the clouds and beyond.\n\nCustomise Your Aircraft- Choose your own color scheme and fly 3 different light aircraft.\n\nFlight Missions - Pick up passengers and test your skills by delivering them to their destination and earn your place on the leaderboard.", "short_d